  "instructions": [
    "heat the robata oil in a fryer to 350°F (180°C).",
    "add the mozzarella balls to the fryer and cook until golden brown, about 2-3 minutes per side.",
    "drain the mozzarella balls on paper towels and set aside.",
    "heat the fryer oil to 375°F (190°C).",
    "add the chopped onion, garlic, and peanuts to the fryer oil and cook until lightly browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the berbere spice mix, tofu, and fenugreek leaves to the fryer oil and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "add the cooked mozzarella balls to the fryer oil and stir to combine.",
    "season with coconut aminos, black pepper, and sesame oil.",
    "garnish with chopped cilantro and serve warm in firm, fired lacquerware bowls (fir-fir)."
